{"5382130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Codeguess","steam_appid":5382130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One word, one number, 25 files<\/h2>Codeguess is a word game for 2 to 24 players. Two teams face off, Red against Teal. Only the two spymasters know which files belong to which team. Each turn they give their agents a single clue: one word and a number. &quot;Ocean 3&quot; means three files are linked to ocean.<br><br>The agents talk it over, mark files and reveal them. Hit one of yours and you keep guessing. A civilian ends your turn, a rival file helps the other team. Reveal the bomb and you lose on the spot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gadget cards: help, sabotage, chaos<\/h2>Each team holds a hidden hand of gadget cards and draws a new one every turn. There are 22 cards in three rarities: common, rare and epic. The Compass lights up the row with the most of your files, X-Ray reveals a civilian. Against the other team you can drop a smoke screen, flip every file into mirror writing or jam the radio so their agents never hear the number. Sabotage stays secret until it strikes.<br><br>Hits earn credits, misses cost them, and credits buy extra cards. The team that's behind draws rare cards more often. Five presets range from &quot;Classic&quot; with no gadgets to &quot;Chaos&quot; with every card, or you build your own set.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An AI spymaster from two players up<\/h2>Not enough people for two spymasters? Let the AI take over for one team or both, so a single agent per team is enough. Pick one of three levels: the Recruit gives simple clues, the Agent plays like a solid teammate, and the Master Spy links up to four files and plays its gadget cards with purpose.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voice chat that knows the rules<\/h2>No Discord needed. Voice chat is built in and decides who hears whom: agents hear each other, including the rival team. Spymasters hear every agent but only talk to each other, so nobody can leak what's on their key card.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More show, more tactics<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Combos up to ×3 for hits in a row and jackpot files with bonus points<br><\/li><li>Radio call: the spymaster records a five-second extra hint, distorted as robot, helium or deep voice<br><\/li><li>Objections with a vote when a clue breaks the rules<br><\/li><li>A debrief after every mission with all clues, the files each spymaster meant and every radio call to replay<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for streaming<\/h2>Streamer mode hides your invite code, and the room code alone won't let anyone in. A privacy screen only shows the spymaster's colors while a key is held. Your Twitch chat can play along too: &quot;!tip word&quot; suggests clues when you're the spymaster, &quot;!card 7&quot; marks files when you're an agent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything included<\/h2>Buy once, play forever. No subscriptions, no in-game purchases.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Nine word packs in English and German, over 1,800 words per language, plus your own words<br><\/li><li>Community word packs from the Steam Workshop, and you can publish your own right from the game<br><\/li><li>All 22 gadget cards and every preset<br><\/li><li>Six file designs: Manila, Classified, Blueprint, Noir, Terminal and Gala<br><\/li><li>Steam achievements, invites through your friends list and Rich Presence<\/li><\/ul>Every player needs their own copy. Invite friends through your Steam friends list or the invite code.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One word, one number, 25 files<\/h2>Codeguess is a word game for 2 to 24 players. Two teams face off, Red against Teal. Only the two spymasters know which files belong to which team. Each turn they give their agents a single clue: one word and a number. &quot;Ocean 3&quot; means three files are linked to ocean.<br><br>The agents talk it over, mark files and reveal them. Hit one of yours and you keep guessing. A civilian ends your turn, a rival file helps the other team. Reveal the bomb and you lose on the spot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gadget cards: help, sabotage, chaos<\/h2>Each team holds a hidden hand of gadget cards and draws a new one every turn. There are 22 cards in three rarities: common, rare and epic. The Compass lights up the row with the most of your files, X-Ray reveals a civilian. Against the other team you can drop a smoke screen, flip every file into mirror writing or jam the radio so their agents never hear the number. Sabotage stays secret until it strikes.<br><br>Hits earn credits, misses cost them, and credits buy extra cards. The team that's behind draws rare cards more often. Five presets range from &quot;Classic&quot; with no gadgets to &quot;Chaos&quot; with every card, or you build your own set.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An AI spymaster from two players up<\/h2>Not enough people for two spymasters? Let the AI take over for one team or both, so a single agent per team is enough. Pick one of three levels: the Recruit gives simple clues, the Agent plays like a solid teammate, and the Master Spy links up to four files and plays its gadget cards with purpose.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voice chat that knows the rules<\/h2>No Discord needed. Voice chat is built in and decides who hears whom: agents hear each other, including the rival team. Spymasters hear every agent but only talk to each other, so nobody can leak what's on their key card.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More show, more tactics<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Combos up to ×3 for hits in a row and jackpot files with bonus points<br><\/li><li>Radio call: the spymaster records a five-second extra hint, distorted as robot, helium or deep voice<br><\/li><li>Objections with a vote when a clue breaks the rules<br><\/li><li>A debrief after every mission with all clues, the files each spymaster meant and every radio call to replay<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for streaming<\/h2>Streamer mode hides your invite code, and the room code alone won't let anyone in. A privacy screen only shows the spymaster's colors while a key is held. Your Twitch chat can play along too: &quot;!tip word&quot; suggests clues when you're the spymaster, &quot;!card 7&quot; marks files when you're an agent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything included<\/h2>Buy once, play forever. No subscriptions, no in-game purchases.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Nine word packs in English and German, over 1,800 words per language, plus your own words<br><\/li><li>Community word packs from the Steam Workshop, and you can publish your own right from the game<br><\/li><li>All 22 gadget cards and every preset<br><\/li><li>Six file designs: Manila, Classified, Blueprint, Noir, Terminal and Gala<br><\/li><li>Steam achievements, invites through your friends list and Rich Presence<\/li><\/ul>Every player needs their own copy. Invite friends through your Steam friends list or the invite code.","short_description":"Two teams, two spymasters, 25 secret files. One word and a number lead to the right files, the bomb ends it all. With gadget cards to help and sabotage, an AI spymaster from two players up, built-in voice chat and Twitch chat help.","supported_languages":"English, German","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/1b09ec4b62d674c64a1db59724c23ccef85f625d\/header.jpg?t=1793743856","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/ff9ca9fdfeccfd3dfe432e8e03819b126f5215a5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793743856","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/ff9ca9fdfeccfd3dfe432e8e03819b126f5215a5\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793743856","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core CPU, 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics with DirectX 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Microphone optional (for voice chat). Online multiplayer requires an internet connection.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 12 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Headset recommended for voice chat.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Joshua Gerke"],"publishers":["Joshua Gerke"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":399,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$3.99"},"packages":[1858712],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Codeguess","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1858712,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Codeguess - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $3.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":399}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":30,"description":"Steam Workshop"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/576af035653f5cd5802f94776fd68a81b27261fc\/ss_576af035653f5cd5802f94776fd68a81b27261fc.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/576af035653f5cd5802f94776fd68a81b27261fc\/ss_576af035653f5cd5802f94776fd68a81b27261fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/81421ae17ffb0cf9b0391cf411b4623e04fdf17a\/ss_81421ae17ffb0cf9b0391cf411b4623e04fdf17a.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/81421ae17ffb0cf9b0391cf411b4623e04fdf17a\/ss_81421ae17ffb0cf9b0391cf411b4623e04fdf17a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/ddcab3f0faac4fc21b295b579dc55f3cce36be5e\/ss_ddcab3f0faac4fc21b295b579dc55f3cce36be5e.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/ddcab3f0faac4fc21b295b579dc55f3cce36be5e\/ss_ddcab3f0faac4fc21b295b579dc55f3cce36be5e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/ceaa310608f707aea0a0a84dbdc581f81de9ef07\/ss_ceaa310608f707aea0a0a84dbdc581f81de9ef07.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/ceaa310608f707aea0a0a84dbdc581f81de9ef07\/ss_ceaa310608f707aea0a0a84dbdc581f81de9ef07.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/3a2314cd380f0aa58a54456c048dd29233dddeb6\/ss_3a2314cd380f0aa58a54456c048dd29233dddeb6.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/3a2314cd380f0aa58a54456c048dd29233dddeb6\/ss_3a2314cd380f0aa58a54456c048dd29233dddeb6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/130e48417af1c4644621bd55748ded2faa3056b7\/ss_130e48417af1c4644621bd55748ded2faa3056b7.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/130e48417af1c4644621bd55748ded2faa3056b7\/ss_130e48417af1c4644621bd55748ded2faa3056b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/167873905d40918aae9e9f85233a6e4e03d705f8\/ss_167873905d40918aae9e9f85233a6e4e03d705f8.600x338.jpg?t=1793743856","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5382130\/167873905d40918aae9e9f85233a6e4e03d705f8\/ss_167873905d40918aae9e9f85233a6e4e03d705f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793743856"}],"movies":[{"id":257445253,"name":"Codeguess – Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257445253\/7d1d7a2f8689ad1ae9d170871805beaaf8f6238b\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793743855","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5382130\/346350972\/b1e98e0bc63bd7da